# Grasping through ce:r_un: arm A takes its tweezers, picks the DIP from
# the tray, puts it in the vise and lets go (the vise holds it); arm D
# picks the LED and lets it fall (lost); then C reaches for where A is
# and stops at the touch.
"ce:" u_se< "Cell"
ce:r_un "reset circuit=demo\ntool A tweezers\npick A U1 grasp=ends\nplace A U1 at=0,0,-32 rpy=0,0,90\nvise close\nrelease A U1\ntool D tweezers\npick D D1 grasp=body\nmove D to=120,40,60\nrelease D D1\nmove C to=0,-20,60 rpy=180,0,0"
